# Receipt

Local-only visit tracker + thermal “VB STUDIO” receipt.

## Files

| Path | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `VisitReceiptContext.tsx` | Session tracking; freezes snapshot on open |
| `ReceiptDock.tsx` | Bottom-right sheet (ticket only, no dialog chrome) |
| `ReceiptTicket.tsx` | Thermal ticket UI |
| `exportReceiptPng.ts` / `downloadReceipt.ts` | PNG export helpers |
| `visitMath.ts` | Token / time math |

## Shell wiring

- Desktop top nav: Lucide `Receipt` next to heatmap `Scan` (`Layout.tsx`)
- Dock: flush bottom, `right-8` (32px); hidden when writing `overlayOpen`
- Stats stay on-device — don’t add analytics backends unless asked
